  "quality_gates": [
    "Every scored finding has a canonical primary DFD interaction or an explicit deferred state.",
    "Missing PRD information is represented as evidence gap, assumption, question, or applicability decision, not as a confirmed vulnerability.",
    "Controls are specific to the relevant threat and interaction.",
    "Tests contain unique target, action, expected observation, and evidence artifact.",
    "The report records source revision, DFD revision, analysis run, methodology, and unresolved blockers."
  ]
